 "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624700_1491182682100098_4328055637240389670_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H9__hh4XPeAQ7kNvwFQxuwE&_nc_oc=AdoQu3tVfyp8Q_qz7hWQPoIm8AxlNv1rSMwcIJ64HcIBvR4loaPmJxP88m3z1ppmVng&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN7sRTqIKGDhggjVdKGhBDQOd01ajRuhRV1NcgwSs2P6g&oe=6AE1EBEC"}, {"file_name": "PICKABOOM Screenshot 7.png", "id": "1871460380468166", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617775_1871460383801499_4177718352564188009_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yePNXAZEGvkQ7kNvwGwzhvT&_nc_oc=AdrJaUrifY_yAsxW6x-bB-JbzlleT1Z5Fro2JmgnmEu8VTjEsmm0ErskZeGKJhsIK04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNpMJBkFgdNuOK-zxQd0mK027OPidykiB-3leOHu-aTuQ&oe=6AE1F446"}, {"file_name": "PICKABOOM Screenshot 8.png", "id": "1202494335071082", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618442_1202494338404415_1314104998578942016_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qP_71YR9gpAQ7kNvwESBdfx&_nc_oc=AdrHexfNgNECDXoutBf32pK7TM7ecWomFY1J77abJ8XjFTs4oDh5IocRciO_tMc25GA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPhEeltjF_-tYc40rQk_JWGOM3LGx_w5U5KSI8rjaCvAw&oe=6AE1ED48"}, {"file_name": "PICKABOOM Screenshot 9.png", "id": "1534195114587820", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617729_1534195117921153_8691084946846864449_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CT5y8xptnoMQ7kNvwEKlm-1&_nc_oc=AdpLI_bSq62dr5N_upqxUkGOjdAmP4wjqThZtpP6Vvc_4cr9hlA1VAak11kPteov-AY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPcC5_X9m2TiiYx1SWCNs4YMhLZTLVlrzBrEbozCJCKnw&oe=6AE1EE81"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape 1 2560x1440 1.png", "id": "684914040932095", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618910_684914044265428_2959950593095626719_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H4o3D1q7vEQQ7kNvwGTUjRN&_nc_oc=AdrOkcb9I4qj0sYymWrPlMv_reBrZMMZVrqS6tzqzodOCTz4TLn6Bk10jVKmkVu4e6U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP4BefhIV2HoA0NhTgxBFsD2rRT5F93m7adIxJSc5Kfzw&oe=6AE1EB6F"}, "display_name": "PICKABOOM", "keywords": ["survival", "naturaldisasters", "funny", "horror", "adventure"], "long_description": "# **PICKABOOM**\n\n# Survive Natural Disasters. Free-to-Play. Weekly Updates. \n\nEnter the explosive world of PICKABOOM, a **multiplayer VR survival game** where every match feels like the end of the world. Team up with your squad to survive floods, quakes, and freak storms before the next cataclysm hits.\n{24914414018221905}\n{1393192055699014}\n\nVisit the **Avatar Shop**, led by VR fashion designer George Hermano, and mix survival gear with outrageous couture. Limited-time \u201cdisaster collections\u201d drop weekly so you can look iconic while the planet collapses around you.\n{698296172970507}\n{775418032145060}\n\nFace terrifyingly **unique monsters** that evolve with every environment, from crawling cave dwellers to colossal storm wraiths. No two encounters are the same.\n{1839225910314692}\n{799801039502319}\n\nWith **weekly updates**, new maps, disasters, and gear drop constantly, keeping the chaos alive. Jump into public or private lobbies, push your friends into danger, or save them just in time.\n{1287406879811240}\n\nJoin our Discord community to test new disasters, play with devs, and help shape PICKABOOM\u2019s future!\n\ud83d\udc49 https://linktr.ee/pickaboomvr\n\n**EQUIP. ADVENTURE. BOOM! PLAY PICKABOOM!** \ud83d\udca5", "short_description": "Survive Natural Disasters in VR! Free-to-Play. Weekly Updates. \n\nTeam up with your squad to survive floods, quakes, and spooky monsters before the next cataclysm hits.\n\nUse your 3D printer to craft new weapons: your own tools decide if you survive\u2026 or not!\n\nNew disasters, maps, and gear drop every week."}]}, "developer_name": null